<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips sees Q4 charge of DFl one billion.</title>
<headline>Philips sees Q4 charge of DFl one billion.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Thursday it anticipated booking a pre-tax charge of one billion guilders in the fourth quarter 1996.</p>
<p>It said that the improvement in its business anticipated in the second half compared to the same period of 1995 was &quot;most unlikely to materialise&quot;.</p>
<p>For the third quarter, the company reported a net profit from normal operations of 123 million guilders against 539 million a year earlier.</p>
</text>
